{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲具体解释了熟悉的亲近为何使欢喜变得迫切、心意未获共同确认为何使倾诉冲动在顶点转为脆弱与停顿、身体为何先于意识握紧以及抓紧为何不能换来保证，并把时间不停流逝解释为甜蜜与不舍同时发生的原因；相对不足是“防备松动”“第一次明显不安”等心理发展判断比当前听感记录更具体，属于合理推演而非音乐本身能够直接证实的事实。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙清楚建立了满足催生延续愿望、延续无法由一人保证、越想抓牢越增加自身牵动的因果链，也解释了最明亮热切时为何仍会失衡、哽住甚至退缩；但它将反复诉说的冲动、身体先于念头的握紧、退弱后并不等于疑问解决的短暂停顿，以及因时间流逝而提前产生的不舍压缩成了概括，对具体转折和身体反应的生成机制交代不足。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"甲 版不差于 乙 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲在保留乙关于延续愿望与未来不可控性的核心框架之外，更完整地解释了各个听感侧面的局部因果、身体先于念头的反应，以及抓紧和反复表达为何不能消除不确定性，因而在具体机制和段内转折的解释力上不弱于乙。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d5f175cc-4da7-4b67-8751-efd1021e62a4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134344898560Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.672, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:44:18.568963+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9db14f4f72dfdbd2af7c94cf3c8d98efac68e748939faf61a7a51ef29c320eb0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f